<title>SOUTH KOREA: Bank of Korea intervenes to support won against dlr.</title>
<headline>Bank of Korea intervenes to support won against dlr.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Korea intervened in afternoon trade, offering to sell dollars at 916.00 won in six-month forward trading, dealers said.</p>
<p>The central bank's offer was estimated at about $30 million.</p>
</text>
